{
  "name": "Oakhollow",
  "category": "Shop templates",
  "kind": "template",
  "summary": "A solid-wood furniture store with shoppable room photos, wood swatches that tint the photo and drawn sizes",
  "about": "A multi-page store for a small joinery that sells solid-wood furniture and home goods, in oat, walnut and moss. Room photos carry pulsing growth-ring hotspots that open a product card, and anything you add lifts off the page and arcs into the bag. Product pages tint the photo as you pick a wood or fabric, draw the piece to scale in SVG and work out a delivery date from your postcode.",
  "how": [
    "Open a page from the top bar: Shop, Collections, Rooms, Journal, Account or the bag",
    "Tap a ring on any room photo to open the piece behind it, then add it or the whole room to the bag",
    "Filter the shop by collection, wood, type, price or ready to ship, and sort or search the results",
    "On a product page pick a wood, fabric and size: the photo tints, the price counts and the drawing redraws",
    "Enter a postcode to see when it arrives, then check out with the demo card form (nothing is charged)",
    "Press Ctrl+K to search pieces, rooms and stories; reset demo data in Account, Settings"
  ],
